# The automap (docs/SCREENS.md 6.1, part s2cap): in E1M1 the map key once
# (the full map), zoom out and in (the minus and equals keys), follow off
# (F: its message), a pan with the arrows, follow on again, the computer
# map (idbehold a: upstream's map of every line, since it has no iddt;
# SCREENS.md 6.1 names iddt), the map key
# again (the overlay: rotate and follow, automapmode 15), a walk and a
# turn with the overlay on, the map key (off).
#
# automapmode (am_map65.s): AM_ACTIVE 1, AM_OVERLAY 2, AM_ROTATE 4,
# AM_FOLLOW 8; the map key goes full, overlay, off [R am_map65.s:323-333].

wait d_main65.s:pagedrawn == 1 within 90s   # the title page is up
at +1s press escape                     # a new game at the default skill
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 0 within 10s
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 0 within 1
at +10f press return
wait m_menu65.s:currentMenu == 2 within 10s
wait m_menu65.s:itemOn == 2 within 1
at +10f press return
wait _g_usergame == 1 within 10s
wait _g_gamestate == 0 within 10s
wait long _g_gametic grows 1 within 60s # E1M1 is loaded
at +2s note level

press tab                               # the full map
wait am_map65.s:automapmode != 0 within 10s
at +20t key down minus                  # zoom out
at +20t key up minus
at +10t key down equals                 # zoom in
at +30t key up equals
at +10t press f                         # follow off (a message)
at +10t key down left                   # pan
at +15t key up left
key down up
at +15t key up up
at +10t key down right
at +10t key up right
at +10t press f                         # follow on (a message)
at +20t type idbeholda                  # the computer map: every line
                                        #   (upstream has no iddt: its
                                        #   map of all lines is the
                                        #   power pw_allmap [R
                                        #   am_map65.s:1720, m_cheat65.s:241])
at +30t press tab                       # the overlay
wait am_map65.s:automapmode == 15 within 10s
at +10t key down up                     # walk with it
at +30t key up up
key down right                          # and turn (it rotates)
at +20t key up right
at +20t press tab                       # off
wait am_map65.s:automapmode == 0 within 10s
at +20t note end
stop
